("note", "DEFINITION", "When an acid solution is mixed with a base solution in the right quantity, the result is neither acidic nor basic. This reaction is **neutralisation**. It forms a **salt and water** and **releases heat**."),
("note", "FORMULA", "**Acid + Base → Salt + Water + Heat**"),
